
The make a project active,  it must be prefixed with an asterisk / star / *. 
Submit a path where the tof-data must be stored for the project separated with 3 underscores. 
After the given path a default subdir "tof_data" will be appended programatically. 

For the active project, all input and output will be expected and stored there, 
except for this file and the executable. 
Only one project can be pre-starred and will be active; following stars will be ignored. 
Removing all stars will reset the data-dir to the executable-dir.



projectname___path/to/some/subdir
otherproject___path/to/otherproject
*testproject01___./testproject


